Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 13:32:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] Crawler security: remove compromised aftjabalpur.in from
 AFT allow-list; block host and subdomains; guard tests and CI

The host formerly configured for AFT Regional Bench Jabalpur now serves
unrelated (betting) content. It is removed from allowed_hosts, added to
blocked_hosts, and check_config now flags any configured URL on a blocked
host (including subdomains). Offline tests prevent reintroduction.
The domain was not visited.

